{"id":"gio7h4rpjlxt2aau117hxtxdg","title":"Multicoin Capital：AI时代DeFi的三大护城河是分发、资本与专有数据","originalTitle":null,"summary":"Multicoin Capital指出，随着AI降低开发成本，DeFi的价值将流向控制稀缺资源的项目。三大护城河分别是分发能力、资本和专有数据。分发能力体现在控制订单流和资金去向，资本则涉及拥有资产负债表和低资金成本，专有数据包括非公开信息和承保能力。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1c80b-7c2d-74d1-8714-bed8d3861afe"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T00:39:18.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T00:43:58.084Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T00:43:58.084Z","category":"opinion","tags":["研究报告","DeFi"],"score":35,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"08e0ffce-7614-4ca2-a3db-a6116398238f","title":"AI技术冲击DeFi生态：协议同质化加剧，护城河转向分发与资本"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"08e0ffce-7614-4ca2-a3db-a6116398238f","title":"AI技术冲击DeFi生态：协议同质化加剧，护城河转向分发与资本"}],"topics":[{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi 与链上"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fRxrqHcNPwUk","reportCount":3,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}